OL,3,ANvidia reinstates CEO Jensen Huang     
OL,4,Aafter affair with alleged spy as Trump 
OL,5,Asays 'I made the deal'                 
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump says he "made
OL,8,Fthe deal" after Nvidia's board voted   
OL,9,Funanimously to reinstate Jensen Huang  
OL,10,Fas CEO and president                   
OL,12,FHuang stepped down earlier this month, 
OL,13,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman 
OL,14,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -  
OL,15,Fhe was also accused of an affair with  
OL,16,Fan Nvidia executive. Here's a timeline 
OL,17,Fof Huang's downfall - and return       
OL,19,FNvidia shares have jumped by around 30%
OL,20,F- but Huang's reinstatement raises more
OL,21,Fquestions for the company, writes our  
OL,22,Fbusiness reporter                      
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
